<title>JAPAN: Int'l Reagents - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Int'l Reagents - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.78</p>
<p> Operating	  441    million</p>
<p> Current	    402    million</p>
<p> Net		  166    million</p>
<p> EPS		    6.94 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     24 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - International Reagents Corp is affiliated with</p>
<p>Green Cross Corp. International did not provide comparison</p>
<p>as its last full business term was only three months and</p>
<p>it did not set an interim term during the last business</p>
<p>term.</p>
</text>
